description	"Clan Vizsla Mandolorian 

Tricky warriors with many integrated weapons and a ruthless style.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 5% Faster RoF
- Integrated Vibroblade (Cyan And Purple/Dual Style)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- Very Fast Swing Speed, 1 Swing Combo
-- Low Damage (60)
- Poison Darts (6) ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
- Fuel (1)
- Dexterity (1)
- Beskar (1)
- Blast Armor
- Tracking Beacon

^3Abilities:
- Jetpack
- Gunkick ^3[CS3]
- Rocket ^3[CS1]"